WEBVTT

01:40.420 --> 01:42.020
If you don't say, I won't ask.

01:48.620 --> 01:49.700
You think the way you are now

01:49.740 --> 01:50.660
is the reason

01:50.700 --> 01:51.940
between you two?

01:56.260 --> 01:57.260
It is me…

02:00.120 --> 02:01.820
I am the reason between us.

02:07.200 --> 02:08.280
You think

02:08.320 --> 02:10.860
you can’t break free from this situation.

02:11.960 --> 02:13.640
So you can't be with her.

02:15.500 --> 02:17.120
But how long do you want her to wait?

02:18.340 --> 02:19.460
Ten years?

02:20.040 --> 02:20.980
Twenty?

02:23.580 --> 02:25.620
When you finally feel ready to go to her…

02:29.560 --> 02:30.520
only to find she's married

02:31.960 --> 02:32.920
and with kids.

02:34.760 --> 02:35.600
What then?

02:39.920 --> 02:41.960
You'll just watch from afar,
wishing Yingtao happiness,

02:42.540 --> 02:44.480
whispering in your heart

02:45.680 --> 02:46.980
that you’ve always loved her.

02:49.700 --> 02:50.660
Jiang Qiaoxi.

02:51.840 --> 02:53.840
Don’t you think your version of the story

02:54.900 --> 02:55.760
is terribly boring

02:56.300 --> 02:57.540
and narcissistic?

03:09.420 --> 03:10.380
Yu Qiao.

03:14.380 --> 03:15.660
Sometimes…

03:18.240 --> 03:19.520
I really envy you.

03:23.020 --> 03:24.320
You should.

03:24.920 --> 03:26.320
Because unlike you,

03:26.360 --> 03:27.460
I have my trust in Yingtao,

03:27.980 --> 03:29.880
And I know her far better.

03:32.760 --> 03:33.720
True.

03:42.120 --> 03:43.080
Please…

03:44.320 --> 03:45.400
don't tell Yingtao…

03:46.600 --> 03:47.580
I'm here.

03:51.360 --> 03:52.480
Why would I tell Yingtao?

03:54.540 --> 03:55.700
What's in it for me?

03:56.760 --> 03:57.960
Then why did you come to me?

03:59.280 --> 04:00.240
I came to you

04:02.080 --> 04:03.180
because you're my friend,

04:04.480 --> 04:05.800
and also the one Yingtao likes.

04:06.820 --> 04:08.660
You just disappeared without a word.

04:08.700 --> 04:09.660
It worries me, too.

04:10.480 --> 04:11.660
But now I see that you're okay.

04:12.480 --> 04:13.580
I'm relieved.

04:17.339 --> 04:18.300
Sorry.

04:24.620 --> 04:25.580
I'm sorry for…

04:26.800 --> 04:27.920
making you worry.

04:28.800 --> 04:29.760
But I…

04:30.520 --> 04:31.700
I really don't know

04:32.320 --> 04:33.580
what else I can do, as I am now.

04:35.200 --> 04:36.160
I accept…

04:36.780 --> 04:37.740
your apology.

04:39.420 --> 04:40.380
But,

04:41.440 --> 04:42.400
when we get back,

04:43.260 --> 04:45.280
I'm going to tell Yingtao that I like her.

05:53.940 --> 05:56.400
You know what? The guy in the next bed

05:56.440 --> 05:57.760
was taken home by his son

05:58.300 --> 06:00.220
because he ran out of money for treatment.

06:03.960 --> 06:04.920
Auntie,

06:04.960 --> 06:06.480
don’t worry,

06:06.520 --> 06:07.860
we’ll pay you in full.

06:09.040 --> 06:10.860
Young man, you've got me all wrong.

06:10.900 --> 06:12.200
That's not what I meant at all.

06:25.480 --> 06:26.440
She's not great.

06:27.060 --> 06:28.740
She pretends everything's normal,

06:29.460 --> 06:30.420
but…

06:30.460 --> 06:32.500
she's been grinding hard.
Tutoring nonstop,

06:32.540 --> 06:34.260
saving every penny.

06:34.300 --> 06:35.720
She says no matter where you are,

06:35.760 --> 06:36.780
she will find you.

06:38.100 --> 06:39.200
You think the way you are now

06:39.240 --> 06:40.160
is the reason

06:40.200 --> 06:41.420
between you two?

06:43.140 --> 06:44.720
But how long do you want her to wait?

06:45.260 --> 06:47.140
Ten years? Twenty?

06:48.480 --> 06:50.660
only to find she's married and with kids.

06:50.700 --> 06:52.760
You'll just watch from afar,
wishing Yingtao happiness,

06:53.340 --> 06:55.480
whispering in your heart

06:55.520 --> 06:56.740
that you’ve always loved her.

07:03.480 --> 07:04.480
Qiaoxi.

07:06.140 --> 07:07.100
You must be exhausted.

07:07.600 --> 07:08.560
Go home and get some rest.

07:15.340 --> 07:16.640
Something on your mind?

07:17.680 --> 07:18.640
No.

07:23.780 --> 07:25.080
I just think…

07:25.120 --> 07:26.840
you’re amazing, Sis-in-law,

07:27.920 --> 07:30.160
taking care of my cousin all this time.

07:32.820 --> 07:33.980
Nothing amazing, really.

07:35.420 --> 07:36.560
Anyone would do the same

07:38.040 --> 07:39.100
in this situation.

07:41.500 --> 07:42.440
Haven’t you been all along

07:42.480 --> 07:43.520
by your cousin's side, too?

07:45.260 --> 07:46.820
I'm his cousin.

07:47.560 --> 07:48.920
This is what I'm supposed to do.

07:50.000 --> 07:52.280
Blood isn’t the only thing
that ties people together.

07:54.820 --> 07:55.780
Go home and get some rest.

07:56.460 --> 07:57.420
Sure.

08:00.680 --> 08:01.800
Quickly.

08:01.840 --> 08:02.800
Go home and get some rest.

08:03.380 --> 08:04.340
I’ll take my leave now.

08:08.940 --> 08:10.220
Ruocheng.

08:10.760 --> 08:11.720
- Hey.
- Hm?

08:12.220 --> 08:13.620
Come, sit up. Let me feed you.

08:13.660 --> 08:16.560
I made your favorite fish porridge.

08:17.100 --> 08:18.220
Picked out all the bones, too.

08:21.780 --> 08:22.980
Don’t be shy!

08:23.620 --> 08:24.960
Oh no.

08:25.460 --> 08:27.460
All these years,
you've kept spoiling me with good food.

08:28.740 --> 08:29.700
I’m scared…

08:31.140 --> 08:32.179
I won’t know how to cope

08:33.020 --> 08:35.280
when I get better.

08:48.360 --> 08:50.100
You really don't study at all, senior?

08:50.860 --> 08:52.360
I'm your senior.

08:52.400 --> 08:54.200
Of course I’m here to supervise you.

08:55.040 --> 08:56.160
Now focus.

08:56.940 --> 08:59.480
All through college,
I barely saw you crack a book.

08:59.520 --> 09:00.920
So how can you end up as the only one

09:00.960 --> 09:02.820
in your class with a guaranteed
grad school spot?

09:05.820 --> 09:07.140
Really wanna know why?

09:16.000 --> 09:17.760
I didn’t study…

09:19.580 --> 09:21.380
precisely because I’m too damn smart.

09:23.820 --> 09:24.740
Seriously.

09:24.780 --> 09:26.260
Why does no one believe me?

09:29.840 --> 09:30.680
Today’s Sunday.

09:30.720 --> 09:32.800
How come our handsome pilot guy
hasn't clocked in yet?

09:33.580 --> 09:36.680
- Did you two have a fight?
- Why would we fight?

09:37.260 --> 09:38.820
He’s probably just busy.

09:38.860 --> 09:40.900
I’ve been swamped with tutoring lately.

09:41.480 --> 09:43.220
It's not like we have to
meet up every week.

09:43.920 --> 09:45.200
Not acceptable.

09:45.240 --> 09:46.320
You gotta maintain this.

09:46.360 --> 09:47.560
Maintain what?

09:48.340 --> 09:50.720
Everyone's busy with their own stuff.
Isn't that perfect?

09:54.240 --> 09:55.400
My dear junior,

09:55.940 --> 09:57.140
What are you going to do?

09:58.940 --> 10:00.700
Your one and only backup option

10:00.740 --> 10:02.280
is about to vanish.

10:02.320 --> 10:03.280
I'm getting secondhand anxiety here.

10:07.340 --> 10:09.800
Senior, now I get
why you made it to grad school.

10:10.580 --> 10:12.920
They must've ranked candidates
by how savage their roasts are.

10:16.120 --> 10:17.060
Hit a nerve, didn’t I?

10:17.100 --> 10:18.560
Look at you, all flustered now.

10:22.920 --> 10:24.020
Don’t be mad.

10:24.060 --> 10:25.440
Here, have some coffee.

10:26.440 --> 10:27.860
It’s for your own good, really.

10:35.400 --> 10:36.360
Who is it?

10:37.180 --> 10:38.280
Why're you staring at my screen?

10:38.820 --> 10:40.100
Not at all!

10:40.140 --> 10:41.800
Geniuses require entertainment.

10:42.340 --> 10:45.140
Yingtao, I’m waiting for you
at your school’s boathouse snack shack.

10:45.180 --> 10:46.400
Come meet me.

10:51.580 --> 10:52.740
Can you return this for me?

10:52.780 --> 10:54.040
Something came up. I gotta run.

10:55.240 --> 10:56.160
Where are you going?

10:56.200 --> 10:57.100
I'll go with you.

11:18.780 --> 11:19.900
Yu Qiao.

11:26.860 --> 11:28.080
You look exhausted.

11:28.120 --> 11:29.360
Did you pull an all-nighter?

11:33.840 --> 11:35.180
Yingtao.

11:35.220 --> 11:36.500
Can you grab me a bottle of water?

11:39.260 --> 11:40.220
Yingtao.

11:43.300 --> 11:44.140
Use my money.

11:45.840 --> 11:47.000
Just a bottle of water.

11:47.040 --> 11:48.240
No need.

11:51.200 --> 11:52.200
- No…
- Just do the legwork.

11:58.640 --> 11:59.600
Sure.

12:00.220 --> 12:01.180
Wait for me.

12:23.060 --> 12:26.140
COFFEE, TEA, PASTRIES, LIGHT BITES

12:35.260 --> 12:36.220
Ying…

13:01.660 --> 13:02.660
Yingtao.

13:03.460 --> 13:04.720
I found Jiang Qiaoxi!

13:05.260 --> 13:06.780
I know where he is.

13:12.040 --> 13:13.720
He’s living at the Fortune Mansion.

13:14.760 --> 13:16.080
When you get to Hong Kong,

13:16.120 --> 13:18.560
remember to take the
Tsuen Wan Line toward Central.

13:19.060 --> 13:20.220
Get off at Admiralty Station

13:21.000 --> 13:22.700
and transfer to

13:22.740 --> 13:23.700
the Island Line.

13:24.560 --> 13:26.640
Exit at Tin Hau Station, Exit A.

13:26.680 --> 13:28.780
Go to the bus stop on King’s Road

13:28.820 --> 13:30.340
and take CityBus Route 2

13:30.380 --> 13:31.620
to Fortune Mansion.

13:33.660 --> 13:35.180
He’s in Unit 1501.

13:36.860 --> 13:39.660
Of course, if all that
sounds too complicated,

13:41.020 --> 13:42.340
just take a taxi straight there.

13:46.480 --> 13:47.540
You went to Hong Kong?

13:48.860 --> 13:49.820
Yingtao.

13:53.720 --> 13:55.340
I won't have time for our meals anymore.

13:56.340 --> 13:58.440
The third-years at the flight academy
are heading to Canada soon.

13:58.480 --> 14:00.500
I’ve got IELTS exams to prep,

14:00.540 --> 14:01.700
and flight school interviews.

14:02.320 --> 14:03.840
Everything’s piling up.

14:07.100 --> 14:08.340
Take care of yourself.

14:17.020 --> 14:17.980
Yu Qiao.

14:19.640 --> 14:20.660
Yu Qiao!

14:22.520 --> 14:23.600
You forgot your wallet!

14:24.480 --> 14:25.320
Left it for you.

14:25.360 --> 14:26.840
Consider your Hong Kong travel funded.

14:27.860 --> 14:29.800
Trying to make me owe you one?

14:29.840 --> 14:30.800
No, thanks.

14:41.360 --> 14:44.980
Yingtao, do you know
the worst thing I’ve ever done?

14:47.420 --> 14:48.260
What is it?

14:49.920 --> 14:51.800
When I first heard about Jiang Qiaoxi,

14:52.880 --> 14:54.760
I didn’t tell you right away.

15:06.820 --> 15:07.940
Yu Qiao.

15:12.020 --> 15:12.860
Thank you!

15:37.800 --> 15:39.040
Lin Yingtao,

15:39.080 --> 15:41.800
have a safe trip to Hong Kong!

15:53.040 --> 15:55.920
I’ll bring back that Ray-Bans for you!

16:18.540 --> 16:25.340
HOI LOON HOTEL

16:26.400 --> 16:29.780
Oi, mate! It's pissing rain.

16:29.820 --> 16:31.140
Don't get sick over the rain.

16:32.960 --> 16:33.800
Jiang Qiaoxi.

16:36.900 --> 16:38.800
Think moping around pays the bills?

16:47.520 --> 16:48.680
Brother Yin.

16:48.720 --> 16:51.780
I find that I am getting more used

16:53.640 --> 16:55.140
to see Hong Kong from here.

16:58.020 --> 16:58.980
Right.

16:59.960 --> 17:02.360
You used to live
in a luxury mansion in Repulse Bay.

17:02.400 --> 17:04.220
Now this place

17:04.260 --> 17:05.920
is smaller than a rat’s nest.

17:09.460 --> 17:11.140
Mr. Landlord for the whole building,

17:11.180 --> 17:12.940
spare me the humblebrag.

17:12.980 --> 17:15.800
Puh-lease. You’ve known
I own buildings forever

17:16.359 --> 17:17.540
and that rent’s due.

17:18.260 --> 17:19.760
Acting shocked now?

17:27.359 --> 17:29.700
Vincent, what’s the deal

17:29.740 --> 17:31.800
with that friend of yours last time?

17:32.340 --> 17:34.220
Ever since he showed up,
you've been acting off.

17:38.600 --> 17:39.860
Someone…

17:41.580 --> 17:42.960
a lot like me.

17:43.000 --> 17:44.220
Where’s the similarity?

17:45.000 --> 17:46.660
Both tall and handsome or what?

17:47.720 --> 17:48.720
He and I…

17:50.160 --> 17:51.360
both look up to…

17:53.440 --> 17:54.480
the same things.

18:02.400 --> 18:03.760
However, he still has a chance,

18:06.200 --> 18:07.240
and I don’t.

18:08.980 --> 18:09.940
Why would you say that?

18:14.900 --> 18:15.820
What's going on with you?

18:20.380 --> 18:21.720
Back then, I thought…

18:22.360 --> 18:23.760
life…

18:23.800 --> 18:25.960
was just a cage.

18:27.800 --> 18:29.460
For my own freedom,

18:29.500 --> 18:30.880
for the people I loved,

18:32.600 --> 18:34.460
I kept searching for the key.

18:37.800 --> 18:39.260
I was so sure…

18:40.700 --> 18:41.920
I am that smart

18:41.960 --> 18:43.700
so I can pick every lock.

18:47.060 --> 18:48.420
Now I see

18:50.500 --> 18:51.480
the world

18:52.160 --> 18:54.040
not only full of notable cages,

18:55.960 --> 18:57.000
but with countless

18:57.960 --> 18:59.180
invisible confinement.

19:00.180 --> 19:01.560
In front of those,

19:04.340 --> 19:05.600
I’m a goddamn fool.

19:09.080 --> 19:10.560
I won’t drag the people I love

19:12.360 --> 19:14.100
into these cages with me.

19:18.400 --> 19:19.360
Look at you,

19:20.740 --> 19:21.940
usually quiet,

19:22.480 --> 19:24.560
but all metaphors when you talk.

19:25.480 --> 19:27.120
My brain’s overheating.

19:30.040 --> 19:32.060
Listen, affections

19:32.100 --> 19:33.660
have nothing to do with cages or keys.

19:34.820 --> 19:36.600
With a face like yours,
that's your free pass.

19:37.620 --> 19:38.900
Quit the tragic act.

19:39.500 --> 19:41.740
Who knows, maybe she’ll
come find you tomorrow.

19:46.380 --> 19:48.460
- Don't you believe it?
- Not that I don't trust you.

19:50.300 --> 19:51.480
It’s that…

19:55.240 --> 19:56.820
she shouldn’t see me like this.

19:59.840 --> 20:01.240
And I refuse to let her.

20:01.280 --> 20:02.960
Relax.

20:03.980 --> 20:05.040
Even when you’re down,

20:05.080 --> 20:06.860
you've got that tragically
handsome vibe going on.

20:07.800 --> 20:09.040
Like that

20:09.080 --> 20:10.440
soaked puppy.

20:13.620 --> 20:15.120
Trust me, wealthy ladies…

20:15.160 --> 20:16.560
- like your type.
- Stop it.

20:20.560 --> 20:22.060
You just got your

20:22.100 --> 20:23.060
You just got the permit this morning

20:23.100 --> 20:24.020
and you're leaving this afternoon?

20:24.060 --> 20:25.580
What’s the fire?

20:25.620 --> 20:27.160
If I don’t go now,

20:27.200 --> 20:29.220
who knows where he’ll vanish next?

20:29.260 --> 20:30.760
California, London,

20:30.800 --> 20:32.140
Spain, Cambodia?

20:32.180 --> 20:33.700
I'd need a decade
to save up for those flights.

20:34.480 --> 20:36.560
At least Hong Kong’s close by.

20:36.600 --> 20:37.960
My goodness.

20:38.000 --> 20:40.100
You think you’ve scored a bargain?

20:42.500 --> 20:44.880
Ever heard of
this little thing called anger?

20:44.920 --> 20:46.660
Why should I be angry?

20:46.700 --> 20:48.700
Why be angry?

20:49.200 --> 20:50.460
He ghosted you,

20:50.500 --> 20:53.260
made you chase him across cities,

20:53.300 --> 20:55.900
and you’re supposed
to be the one demanding answers.

20:55.940 --> 20:57.620
Why are you so happy about it?

20:59.200 --> 21:00.760
Just finding him,

21:00.800 --> 21:01.780
seeing him again,

21:02.360 --> 21:03.500
that's enough to make me happy.

21:04.520 --> 21:05.760
We'll figure it out when we meet.

21:07.520 --> 21:08.480
Honestly baffling.

21:09.020 --> 21:10.240
You’ve got a life like princesses

21:10.280 --> 21:11.580
but choose to chew on misery

21:12.260 --> 21:13.340
like it’s gourmet.

21:15.220 --> 21:16.800
Me? A princess?

21:17.500 --> 21:18.460
He’s the princess,

21:19.640 --> 21:22.020
forever stuck in some tower,

21:22.060 --> 21:23.300
waiting for me to rescue him.

21:25.880 --> 21:28.420
Should I call this love stronger than gold

21:28.460 --> 21:29.980
or just someone never learned from pain?

21:31.320 --> 21:32.280
Let me help you.

21:33.160 --> 21:35.040
Wish me smooth sailing then.

21:39.740 --> 21:41.680
A girl traveling all that way alone.

21:41.720 --> 21:43.300
Safety first.

21:43.340 --> 21:45.680
- Got it.
- And Hong Kong’s

21:45.720 --> 21:47.620
new to you,

21:47.660 --> 21:49.100
so keep your stuff glued to you.

21:49.140 --> 21:50.620
If anything happens, call me anytime.

21:50.660 --> 21:52.260
- Got it?
- Got it!

21:52.300 --> 21:53.400
Don’t worry.

21:53.440 --> 21:54.420
I’m gonna be late.

21:55.520 --> 21:56.680
Bye, Senior.

21:58.360 --> 22:00.080
Stay safe, and come back soon.

24:20.700 --> 24:22.920
WEST WING, FORTUNE MANSION

24:41.080 --> 24:42.780
- Hello.
- Who are you looking for?

24:42.820 --> 24:43.780
I…

24:45.680 --> 24:47.020
I'm here to visit a friend

24:47.060 --> 24:48.720
and I want to go in, okay?

24:51.800 --> 24:52.940
Thanks. Thank you.

25:18.060 --> 25:19.360
Hello!

25:19.400 --> 25:22.220
Hello, is this the West Wing
of Fortune Mansion?

25:30.640 --> 25:32.360
Do you know this person?

25:32.400 --> 25:35.380
Jiang Qiaoxi. He’s in Unit 1501.

25:35.420 --> 25:36.860
I’m trying to find him.

25:37.400 --> 25:38.840
I don’t understand.

25:54.420 --> 25:56.460
You can’t go up.

25:56.500 --> 25:57.520
Wait here.

26:40.040 --> 26:41.900
Do you know Jiang Qiaoxi?

26:42.400 --> 26:46.660
WEST WING, FORTUNE MANSION

27:18.620 --> 27:20.400
Hey, miss. You can't sleep here.

27:21.140 --> 27:22.200
Not a place for sleeping.

27:39.040 --> 27:40.680
Little sister, you…

27:40.720 --> 27:42.220
- What are you going to do?
- Wait.

27:42.260 --> 27:43.220
Stop!

27:43.260 --> 27:44.100
If you alert the police,

27:44.140 --> 27:44.980
they'll come after you.

27:45.020 --> 27:46.420
I mean no harm, okay?

27:47.280 --> 27:49.480
Hey! Why’d you let a girl sleep here?

27:49.520 --> 27:51.140
Wasn't it you
who said no one's allowed in?

27:51.180 --> 27:52.200
So I just kicked her out.

27:53.460 --> 27:54.680
What are you doing?

27:54.720 --> 27:55.860
Are you here to look for someone?

27:56.400 --> 27:57.500
Answer him.

27:57.540 --> 27:59.720
He's the owner of this mansion.

28:02.040 --> 28:03.220
He asked to answer me.

28:03.260 --> 28:05.040
I'm the owner of this mansion.

28:07.980 --> 28:10.480
You're the owner?

28:12.120 --> 28:14.140
This one, and this one.

28:14.180 --> 28:15.720
This entire building belongs to me.

28:15.760 --> 28:17.460
Anyone who wants to live here

28:18.100 --> 28:19.000
needs my approval.

28:30.580 --> 28:31.600
Are you looking for someone?

28:32.280 --> 28:33.860
Then, among your tenants,

28:33.900 --> 28:35.760
is there a boy named…

28:35.800 --> 28:37.580
Jiang Qiaoxi?

28:38.940 --> 28:40.340
Yes!

28:40.380 --> 28:42.120
Exactly! Jiang Qiaoxi. Do you know him?

28:42.820 --> 28:45.380
I told that uncle too.

28:46.440 --> 28:48.040
Plenty of girls

28:48.080 --> 28:49.420
come asking for Jiang Qiaoxi,

28:50.140 --> 28:52.520
but I never let a single one in.

28:53.620 --> 28:54.580
No!

28:56.260 --> 28:57.180
But I…

29:03.800 --> 29:04.780
Would you like to come in?

29:28.280 --> 29:29.280
This way.

29:32.580 --> 29:33.640
Be careful.

29:33.680 --> 29:34.640
Thanks.

29:44.640 --> 29:45.640
Just this room.

29:46.420 --> 29:51.500
UPSTAIRS HERE, FOOT HEALTH, PERM

30:00.360 --> 30:01.740
I rented it to him dirt cheap.

30:09.820 --> 30:11.060
Honestly,

30:11.680 --> 30:12.640
I’ve seen you before.

30:14.880 --> 30:15.920
Go inside, you'll understand.

30:20.660 --> 30:21.940
Thanks.

30:21.980 --> 30:22.940
You're welcome.

30:30.380 --> 30:31.340
Thanks.

30:55.380 --> 30:56.380
Qing!

30:57.000 --> 30:58.760
What’s with all this clutter?

30:58.800 --> 31:00.260
Trying to kill someone?

31:00.900 --> 31:01.860
Alright.

31:04.440 --> 31:05.700
Brother Han.

31:08.260 --> 31:09.600
I've put them inside,

31:09.640 --> 31:10.600
Brother Han.

31:11.400 --> 31:12.420
Seriously? At this hour?

31:12.460 --> 31:13.420
What do you want?

31:13.460 --> 31:15.320
I already paid rent this month.

31:16.660 --> 31:17.720
I pay you.

31:18.920 --> 31:20.020
Sis-in-law Qing.

31:20.060 --> 31:21.060
Brother Han, what's the matter?

31:21.100 --> 31:22.680
I rent your house
for a few hours to watch the show.

31:22.720 --> 31:23.920
What show?

32:12.920 --> 32:15.240
DOUBLE CELEBRATION: QIXI & START OF AUTUMN

32:15.280 --> 32:20.060
MAJESTIC OPENING CEREMONY:
THE HAN SPIRIT SWEEPS ACROSS THE WORLD

32:20.100 --> 32:23.560
CHEER TOGETHER ON
BOTH SIDES OF VICTORIA HARBOUR

32:23.600 --> 32:25.260
CERTIFICATE OF APPRECIATION

32:29.640 --> 32:32.300
EARTHQUAKE SUPPORT IN ACTION

32:32.340 --> 32:34.220
EARTHQUAKE RELIEF OPERATIONS

32:34.260 --> 32:35.400
A 7.8-MAGNITUDE EARTHQUAKE
STRUCK WENCHUAN COUNTY

32:44.660 --> 32:48.300
YINGTAO

32:54.860 --> 32:56.940
CHINESE NEW YEAR'S EVE

33:11.880 --> 33:14.500
YINGTAO, HAPPY FOURTH OF MAY

33:14.540 --> 33:16.900
HAPPY BIRTHDAY, YINGTAO

33:16.940 --> 33:21.380
CHINESE NEW YEAR'S EVE

34:36.920 --> 34:37.980
A thief.

34:40.280 --> 34:41.300
A liar.

35:00.320 --> 35:04.500
CÉLINE DION

35:04.540 --> 35:07.620
TITANIC

35:07.660 --> 35:10.320
GRAMMY NOMINATES

35:10.360 --> 35:11.640
TITANIC

37:26.660 --> 37:28.140
Vincent.

37:28.180 --> 37:29.620
You didn't come to the moon,

37:29.660 --> 37:31.420
the moon came to you.

37:32.080 --> 37:34.180
Lay off those late-night dramas.

38:19.120 --> 38:20.680
You idiot!

38:20.720 --> 38:22.100
What’s gotten into you?

38:22.140 --> 38:23.580
Why did you let her into my room?

38:23.620 --> 38:24.460
Vincent.

38:24.500 --> 38:26.140
Why swear at me in Cantonese?

38:26.660 --> 38:28.880
Afraid that miss might
understand your swearing?

38:29.900 --> 38:30.960
Hey asshole,

38:31.000 --> 38:32.360
All those girls I turned down for you.

38:32.400 --> 38:33.340
You have never thanked me.

38:33.920 --> 38:34.860
Now you yell at me

38:34.900 --> 38:36.340
for letting one in.

38:36.380 --> 38:37.380
I didn't do it randomly.

38:37.420 --> 38:38.860
I’ve seen her photos

38:38.900 --> 38:39.820
all over

38:39.860 --> 38:42.240
- your room!
- Shut up!

38:42.800 --> 38:44.860
Guilty conscience.

38:44.900 --> 38:46.060
Hey Vincent.

38:47.080 --> 38:48.500
That little sister is here?

38:48.540 --> 38:49.820
Really?

38:49.860 --> 38:53.900
Vincent, Love-Struck Saber!

38:53.940 --> 38:54.800
Brother Han.

38:55.580 --> 38:56.420
You didn't tell me.

38:56.460 --> 38:58.760
- Shut up!
- It's none of your business!

39:00.840 --> 39:02.820
He has closed the door!

39:02.860 --> 39:04.760
The door was closed.

39:04.800 --> 39:06.360
Let's leave them.

39:15.260 --> 39:16.220
Jiang Qiaoxi.

39:21.040 --> 39:22.140
Is it you?

39:39.320 --> 39:40.280
The elevator's broken out here.

39:42.640 --> 39:44.460
You’ll have to crash at my place tonight.

39:44.500 --> 39:46.040
I’ll bunk over at Han Yin’s.

39:46.080 --> 39:47.320
Tomorrow, I'll grab a meal with you

39:47.360 --> 39:48.400
before you fly out.

39:53.060 --> 39:54.080
I didn't come to Hong Kong

39:54.120 --> 39:55.540
just to have one meal with you.

39:58.300 --> 39:59.540
Alright then,

39:59.580 --> 40:01.720
stay in Hong Kong a few more days.

40:01.760 --> 40:02.780
I’ll book you a hotel.

40:03.320 --> 40:05.360
You’d love Disneyland or Ocean Park,

40:05.960 --> 40:06.920
trust me.

40:07.420 --> 40:08.560
I don't want Disney.

40:09.700 --> 40:11.060
I didn’t come for Ocean Park, either.

40:11.900 --> 40:13.680
I came because you’re here.

40:14.740 --> 40:15.620
Jiang Qiaoxi.

40:17.900 --> 40:19.600
You're the one
who told me not to forget you.

40:25.980 --> 40:28.260
Yingtao, I’ve moved on with my life now.

40:29.780 --> 40:31.120
Does your new life

40:32.940 --> 40:33.980
include

40:34.020 --> 40:36.540
cutting off everyone from the past?

40:37.900 --> 40:40.000
And that includes me too, doesn’t it?

40:43.760 --> 40:44.720
Yes.

40:46.000 --> 40:47.560
I'm doing really well now,

40:49.820 --> 40:50.880
living my life

40:50.920 --> 40:51.880
with purpose.

40:52.680 --> 40:53.780
You should too, Yingtao.

40:53.820 --> 40:55.000
Then why did you

40:55.040 --> 40:56.660
talk about the future back then?

40:56.700 --> 40:58.580
Why did you ask me not to forget you?

40:58.620 --> 40:59.880
Then you just disappear

40:59.920 --> 41:01.600
- without a word?
- Because I don't need it.

41:01.640 --> 41:02.640
Yingtao, I just don’t.

41:02.680 --> 41:04.040
Don’t need what?

41:05.220 --> 41:07.380
You’re standing in a room full of me,

41:07.420 --> 41:09.380
saying that, you really think
that is convincing?

41:09.420 --> 41:10.380
Jiang Qiaoxi?

41:19.560 --> 41:20.560
Why do you always

41:20.600 --> 41:22.220
lock yourself away?

41:24.260 --> 41:25.300
The second something

41:25.340 --> 41:26.460
goes wrong,

41:27.540 --> 41:29.220
you just get into your own blind alley.

41:30.280 --> 41:31.800
Stuck in that narrow-minded bullshit.

41:33.280 --> 41:34.640
You make decisions alone

41:34.680 --> 41:35.880
and expect everyone

41:35.920 --> 41:37.440
to follow.

41:43.960 --> 41:45.960
I fought like hell to get here.

41:47.780 --> 41:48.740
I’m not leaving.

42:18.800 --> 42:19.760
Jiang Qiaoxi.

42:25.380 --> 42:27.340
I’ve had so many dreams,

42:28.760 --> 42:29.720
like in different

42:29.760 --> 42:31.220
parallel universes.

42:31.740 --> 42:33.620
There are so many versions of you.

42:35.780 --> 42:37.860
Every one of them ends differently.

42:44.240 --> 42:45.960
Even you from other universes

42:48.860 --> 42:50.180
would never picture me

42:52.360 --> 42:54.060
like what I am now.

45:09.640 --> 45:11.800
Subtitle translation by: Wanjiao Song
